{
 "version": 1,
 "note": "Every automation in LynkOmni (owner approved 2026-11-08, master blueprint section 45). The engine is LynkFlow; LynkAssist is the AI layer. Levels: inform (tell only), draft (prepare, a person confirms), auto_undo (does it, can be undone within the owner's limits), auto (housekeeping and messages the person already chose). tests/test_automations.py enforces the safety rules.",
