 "rules": [
  "Sensitive work (credentials, recovery, tax filing, payroll, finance requests, exchange, personal data, consent) is only ever inform or draft.",
  "Books, purchases and partner routing may run as auto_undo within the owner's limits, never plain auto.",
  "Anything that moves money is a draft a person confirms, or runs under the customer's own standing instruction held by the licensed provider, capped and told every time.",
  "Customer messages need a basis: the transaction itself (receipts, order steps, case replies) or the person's opt-in (everything else), with quiet hours and their language.",
  "LynkAssist explains, answers, drafts, summarises and watches; it never moves money, changes credentials, completes recovery, files with an authority, decides credit, or acts without the confirmation its level needs; its suggestions are labelled 'Suggested by LynkAssist'.",
  "Every run is an event (AutomationTriggered, AutomationDrafted, AutomationApplied, AutomationUndone, AutomationSkipped), idempotent, loop-guarded, with 'Why did this happen?' and an off switch."
 ]
}
